{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>He sent such things.</b> Like the gift he gave his brothers, he sent his father a load <b>of ten donkeys</b> of changes of clothing. <b>Of the best of Egypt</b> — of fine linen and embroidery, dressed stone from Egypt. Ten donkeys, and ten she-donkeys for his ten brothers, for each man two beasts to drive; even though Benjamin returned with them, he did not wish to burden him."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 45, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:08:40.700641169Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}